igorrilho, você vive com tudo por perto com bons restaurantes, serviços, mercados e fácil acesso ao Centro, em um dos bairros mais desejados de Curitiba.\n\nNo fim, este não é só um apartamento. É um espaço que acolhe, facilita a rotina e eleva a forma de viver, com sofisticação na medida certa.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69de34f18dfd7bc8aa42209d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/cbf76159-7663-4102-b83c-573e5ae5a4cb.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69de34f18dfd7bc8aa42209d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5982b13e-41aa-4d09-825b-86b8ea9e1e65.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69de34f18dfd7bc8aa42209d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/60f90f69-a581-4c21-ba1b-4e61afe307bf.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69de34f18dfd7bc8aa42209d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/529bde24-f887-4057-8477-595d1bd6f40b.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69de34f18dfd7bc8aa42209d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f00cfa63-783e-4dc2-851b-7ad0526d2d1d.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69de34f18dfd7bc8aa42209d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/bb7c5315-d91f-4a13-ade8-3a71cb8af1c4.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69de34f18dfd7bc8aa42209d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/eef819ed-6872-4b7d-a63a-2215f6d7c521.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69de34f18dfd7bc8aa42209d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/138da9ed-900e-4f49-9d7c-35eb54d1c466.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69de34f18dfd7bc8aa42209d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/7a27adaa-471f-4f50-b5d3-a821b0cb4283.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69de34f18dfd7bc8aa42209d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/1d1f70a6-841f-455a-a5d1-4908ff9debe1.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69de34f18dfd7bc8aa42209d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f26c3989-70ef-40fc-a9b2-4298b4752288.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69